  "end": {
    "name": "m4trix:run.completed"
  },
  "walkthrough": [
    "`user-message` is published on `main` from outside the network; `planner` picks it up.",
    "`planner` receives it and emits `plan` on `plans`, a channel that only carries `plan`; `executor` takes it from there.",
    "`executor` receives it and emits `answer` on `client`, a channel that only carries `answer`; no agent subscribes to `client`, so `answer` leaves the network through its `sse` proxy and, as a terminal event, ends the run.",
    "The runtime then publishes `m4trix:run.completed` on every channel (`main`, `plans` and `client`) to close the run."
  ]
}
